    "duration": 1.593
  },
  {
    "text": "Everybody dance!",
    "lang": "en",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/4bda634ec2120f8f62d2d0e5.mp3",
    "duration": 1.488
  },
  {
    "text": "Добро пожаловать в наш сад!",
    "lang": "ru",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/22dc49a888888455ab608850.mp3",
    "duration": 1.75
  },
  {
    "text": "Оставьте мне морковку!",
    "lang": "ru",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/acea528ad2bf9cc5ad3c6723.mp3",
    "duration": 1.75
  },
  {
    "text": "Все танцуют!",
    "lang": "ru",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/6880e0dfd8e966cb7c73e262.mp3",
    "duration": 1.358
  },
  {
    "text": "Bear, I'm making you pancakes!",
    "lang": "en",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/34f4659ce3686adb323815be.mp3",
    "duration": 2.795
  },
  {
    "text": "Pancakes need lots of flour!",
    "lang": "en",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/6ea5d6393ff3156e9490f0d8.mp3",
    "duration": 2.22
  },
  {
    "text": "No peeking, Bear!",
    "lang": "en",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/2c98523d4c3099727fdadf59.mp3",
    "duration": 1.306
  },
  {
    "text": "Breakfast is ready, Bear!",
    "lang": "en",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/d3eba922a37a3f46d872ba2c.mp3",
    "duration": 1.906
  },
  {
    "text": "Мишка, я испеку тебе блины!",
    "lang": "ru",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/963bfc39c3d8fe109ce626ef.mp3",
    "duration": 2.429
  },
  {
    "text": "Для блинов нужно много-много муки!",
    "lang": "ru",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/5197c4c57b1ce6ce18475252.mp3",
    "duration": 2.899
  },
  {
    "text": "Мишка, не подглядывай!",
    "lang": "ru",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/1e0b4d7fd34f14541770e666.mp3",
    "duration": 2.011
  },
  {
    "text": "Мишка, завтрак готов!",
    "lang": "ru",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/8291b86f162dee543e132576.mp3",
    "duration": 2.507
  },
  {
    "text": "Bear is sleeping? Not for long!",
    "lang": "en",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/1d412896b0cccebcaf54332f.mp3",
    "duration": 2.899
  },
  {
    "text": "Bear, wake up! Let's play!",
    "lang": "en",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/0ee0e8c08de5e34eacdf2920.mp3",
    "duration": 2.586
  },
  {
    "text": "Faster, Bear, faster!",
    "lang": "en",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/57a0a4a3998185c2f04d1fc0.mp3",
    "duration": 1.645
  },
  {
    "text": "Good night, Bear. Let's play again tomorrow!",
    "lang": "en",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/2bf7ce5bad0088ccc0a91461.mp3",
    "duration": 2.899
  },
  {
    "text": "Мишка спит? Это ненадолго!",
    "lang": "ru",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/5b2826fe2cfca4db79fc27b1.mp3",
    "duration": 2.899
  },
  {
    "text": "Мишка, вставай! Давай играть!",
    "lang": "ru",
    "url": "/assets/voices/masha/f2b06d9b3c234081bdb71abe.mp3",
    "duration": 3.108
  },
  {
    "text": "Быстрее, Мишка, быстрее!",
